      "raw_mention": "Central Glass",
      "text": ">> TSMC Expects No Impact on Current Operations from Reports of Japan’s Central Glass Halting High-Purity Tungsten Hexafluoride Production\n\n• Amid market reports that Japan’s Central Glass, a gas supplier to TSMC, may halt production of high-purity tungsten hexafluoride (WF₆) due to shortages of raw materials sourced from mainland China, TSMC said it does not currently expect any impact on its operations.\n\n• TSMC said that, as part of its global procurement strategy, it continues to develop multi-source supply solutions and diversify its global supplier base, providing resilience against potential supply risks.",
